<section class="vu-terms" aria-labelledby="vu-terms-title">
  <div class="vu-section-head"><div><span class="vu-eyebrow">Before you upgrade</span><h2 id="vu-terms-title">Clear expectations, no hidden assumptions.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="vu-terms-grid">
    <details><summary>Pricing, GST and commission</summary><p>Pricing is tentative, in Indian Rupees and exclusive of GST. Commission applies to product sale value; payment-gateway, shipping, returns, taxes and other deductions follow the final seller agreement.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Events, creators and photoshoots</summary><p>Availability, deliverables, rights, logistics and production scope require a separately confirmed brief. Plan access does not guarantee sales, reach or creator output.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Benefits, upgrades and validity</summary><p>Benefits must be used during the subscription term. Upgrade credits are discretionary and unused benefits are non-transferable unless confirmed in writing.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Global exposure and support</summary><p>Export readiness, compliance and commercial conversion remain brand responsibilities unless contracted separately. Support levels describe service ownership, not 24-hour availability.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>

